TITLE

 uniform flow field - dedolomitization

UNITS

        -time                   day

        -horizontal_grid        meters

        -vertical_grid          meters

        -head                   meters

        -hydraulic_conductivity m/day

        -specific_storage       1/m

        -dispersivity           m

        -well_diameter          meters

        -well_flow_rate         gpm

SOLUTION_METHOD

        -iterative_solver       true

        -tolerance              1e-10

        -space_differencing     0

        -time_differencing      1.

FLOW_ONLY       false

STEADY_FLOW true

GRID

        -uniform x

                0.00000      10.0    41

        -uniform y

                0.00000      10.0    2

        -uniform z

                0.00000      1.0     2

        -print_orientation XY

#        -chemistry_dimensions XY

FLUID_PROPERTIES

        -compressibility        0.0             #1/Pa

        -density                1000.           #kg/m^3

        -viscosity              0.001           #Pa-s

        -diffusivity            0.0             #m^2/s

MEDIA

        -zone   0 0 0 10  10 1

                -porosity               0.3

                -long_dispersivity      0.1

                -trans_dispersivity     0.01

                -Kx                     1

                -Ky                     1

                -Kz                     1       # m/d

                -storage                0

SPECIFIED_VALUE_BC

        -zone   0 0 0 0 10  1

                -head           3.00

                -associated_solution    1

        -zone   10 0 0 10 10 1

                -head           0.0

                -associated_solution    2

WELL Breakthough

                10. 0.

                -diameter 0.05

                -pumping_rate 0.

                -elevation 0. 1.0

FREE_SURFACE_BC false

HEAD_IC

        -zone   0. 0. 0. 10. 10. 1.

                -head   1.

CHEMISTRY_IC

        -zone   0. 0. 0. 10. 10. 1.

                -solution               2

                -equilibrium_phases     2

TIME_CONTROL

        -delta_time     0.025     day

        -end_time       210000    day

PRINT_INITIAL

        -velocities             true

        -xyz_head               true

        -HDF_heads              true

PRINT_FREQUENCY

        -hdf_chemistry          210000     day

        -xyz_chemistry          30000      day

        -bc_flow_rates          210000     day

        -xyz_components         210000     day

        -xyz_head               210000     day

        -xyz_velocity           210000     day

        -xyz_wells              25        day

        -save_final_heads       true

END

